# Project-Specific Overrides

This directory is for project-specific customizations that override or extend the global AI customization standards.

Place any project-specific customization files here. They will be loaded after the global standards, allowing you to:
- Override specific behaviors for this project
- Add project-specific requirements
- Maintain local standards that don't apply globally

Example files you might add:
- `project-standards.md` - Project-specific standards
- `local-templates.md` - Project-specific templates
- `custom-workflows.md` - Project-specific workflows